# One job per line:
# <minute> <hour> <day_of_month> <month> <day_of_week> <command>
#
# Examples:
# */5 * * * * node /app/build/index.js releases.rescrape 200
# */30 * * * * node /app/build/index.js artists
# 0 */6 * * * node /app/build/index.js yearly.albums.sync 2026
# 15 2 * * * node /app/build/index.js releases.labels.backfill 500
# 30 2 * * * node /app/build/index.js releases.categories.missing.label "ArtistShare" tmp/artistshare_missing_category_albums.txt
#
# Jobs use UTC and run from /app with the container environment.
# Output files under tmp/ and logs/ persist to the host.
# Restart app-cron after editing the jobs file. See docker/README.md.
